Business; 
The business responded, that they never charge workers any recruitment fees. For the workers that were recruited under the "Recalibration Program" were handled by the runner that Ramatex has. If there are any workers who want to leave the job, Triston is the one who signs the resignation. Triston so far has not received any resignation letter that needs his signature from Blueberry and Blueberry is the factory that has lest turnover rate. If workers want to leave the job, they can just fill out the resignation simply and the rest process will be handled by HR and other relevant teams. Triston will do his own internal investigation making sure safeguard for the worker is in place. 

The document process is taking longer than expected from the government side, the government has announced it to finalize the processes at the end of this year.

Worker; 

