Business; 
Triston from HR responded saying that he has visited the Blueberry site to very some of the highlights about this issue and also has checked with other facilities to make sure everything is aligned. 


Worker; 
The worker updated that she had to go to immigration to collect her passport and now the passport is with her. She also added that there was another Nepalese worker who also went to the immigration to collect his passport. It is added that many Nepalese workers are planning to resign from Blueberry. She said that she also received her remaining salary which is 800 MYR from the business which she did not expect to receive before Issara's involvement to raise her case with the business. 







