Context: The issue with insufficient food vendors to meet workers' needs. A group of workers reported not having food vendors for them to have their meals after working hours. As workers are not allowed to cook inside their housing, they have to rely on the food vendors around their housing. They also do not have options if food vendors do not come to their area because their housing is located in an isolated area. Recently, it has been a few days since the local authorities have been spot-checking, and vendors are afraid of being spotted and start to run away. Since the vendors are running away of afraid of coming to sell the food, workers are not having enough food. 

Recommendations; 

The business to find a way to settle the issue and make sure workers have enough options for their meals.

